From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:05:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(render): ceil layout size reports to the hundredth

Replace the +0.005 bias used before %.2f formatting on Android, iOS, OHOS
and Web with a representation-aware ceiling to two decimals. Measured sizes
still never round down, but exact values (10.00) are no longer inflated to
10.01. Android's null-size wire value becomes 0.00|0.00, matching Web.

Fork-Patch: render-ceil-layout-size-report
Origin: 08553ec9
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
